{"id":"473439958a92cf5b","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Open Set","display":"df-zfc-top5-open-set — ZFC Top5 Open Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-open-set"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-open-set — ZFC Top5 Open Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-open-set — ZFC Top5 Open Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,U\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land U\\subseteq X\n\\land U\\in\\tau .\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land U\\subseteq X\n\\land U\\in\\tau .\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Open sets are carrier subsets that are members of the declared topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land U\\subseteq X\n\\land U\\in\\tau .\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":867,"backlinks":[{"id":"1098ccda94d64a25","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},